   "version": "Introduced in Senate",
   "date": "2009-03-03",
   "text": "Fairness in Nursing Home Arbitration Act - Provides that a pre-dispute arbitration agreement between a long-term care facility and a resident (or anyone acting on the resident's behalf) shall not be valid or specifically enforceable."
